"A tiny plastic toilet for use in a travel trailer.  Unlike a normal toilet, "
"it doesn't store water locally for you to siphon out."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Bashing sound
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/bullet_trailer.json
msgid "plastic cracking!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/bullet_trailer.json
msgid "trailer sofa"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "trailer sofa"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/bullet_trailer.json
msgid ""
"A folding trailer sofa with a durable, somewhat comfortable weave of coarse "
"red fabric."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/bullet_trailer.json
msgid "trailer bed"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "trailer bed"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/bullet_trailer.json
msgid "A small but comfy-looking double bed."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/bullet_trailer.json
msgid "plywood sign for 'Dana's Bakery'"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "plywood sign for 'Dana's Bakery'"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/bullet_trailer.json
msgid "A spraypainted plywood sign reads 'Dana's Bakery' in red letters."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/sunken_helicopter_furniture.json
msgid "waterlogged aisle"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "waterlogged aisle"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/sunken_helicopter_furniture.json
msgid ""
"A waterlogged aisle.  It has started to degrade after some time spent "
"underwater.  Absolutely unrecoverable."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/sunken_helicopter_furniture.json
msgid "waterlogged board"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "waterlogged board"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/sunken_helicopter_furniture.json
msgid ""
"A waterlogged metal wall.  Keeps zombies outside the vehicle and prevents "
"people from seeing through it.  It has started to degrade after some time "
"spent underwater.  Absolutely unrecoverable."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/sunken_helicopter_furniture.json
msgid "waterlogged quarterpanel"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "waterlogged quarterpanel"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/sunken_helicopter_furniture.json
msgid ""
"A waterlogged half-height metal wall.  Keeps zombies outside the vehicle but "
"allows people to see over it.  It has started to degrade after some time "
"spent underwater.  Absolutely unrecoverable."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/sunken_helicopter_furniture.json
msgid "waterlogged windshield"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "waterlogged windshield"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/sunken_helicopter_furniture.json
msgid ""
"A waterlogged sheet of glass that lets you see outside the vehicle.  It has "
"started to degrade after some time spent underwater.  Absolutely "
"unrecoverable."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/sunken_helicopter_furniture.json
msgid "waterlogged frame"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "waterlogged frame"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/sunken_helicopter_furniture.json
msgid ""
"A waterlogged metal framework.  Other vehicle components can be mounted on "
"it, and it can be attached to other frames to increase the vehicle's size.  "
"It has started to degrade after some time spent underwater.  Absolutely "
"unrecoverable."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/sunken_helicopter_furniture.json
msgid "waterlogged bucket seat"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "waterlogged bucket seat"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/sunken_helicopter_furniture.json
msgid ""
"A waterlogged soft upholstered car seat, contoured to hold one person.  It "
"has started to degrade after some time spent underwater.  Absolutely "
"unrecoverable."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/sunken_helicopter_furniture.json
msgid "waterlogged roof"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "waterlogged roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/sunken_helicopter_furniture.json
msgid "A waterlogged metal roof.  Absolutely unrecoverable."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/sunken_helicopter_furniture.json
msgid "waterlogged heavy-duty military Blackhawk rotors"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "waterlogged heavy-duty military Blackhawk rotors"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/sunken_helicopter_furniture.json
msgid ""
"A set of four military-grade helicopter rotor blades, used to provide lift by"
" rotation.  It has started to degrade after some time spent underwater.  "
"Absolutely unrecoverable."
msgstr ""

